      {
        "html": "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Small_crystal_seed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Small crystal seed</a>; you can take it either to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ilfeen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ilfeen</a> in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Isafdar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Isafdar</a> or the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Singing_bowl_(Brimstail%27s_home)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">singing bowl</a> in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Brimstail%27s_cave\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Brimstail&#39;s cave</a> to turn it into a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Crystal_saw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">crystal saw</a>. It allows you to make items that require a saw and 3 levels above your <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Construction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Construction</a> level. It has only 28 charges; however, the recharge is free.",
